      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transparency is the cornerstone of our service at Packers and Movers Kantatoli, Ranchi. We believe that trust is built not just on successful deliveries, but on absolute clarity regarding costs and liabilities. Our commitment to zero moving-day surcharges ensures that the quote you receive is the final price you pay.</p>
<p>We eliminate all hidden costs, such as fuel adjustments, floor charges, or urgent handling fees, which are common pitfalls in the local industry. By providing a fixed, all-inclusive rate upfront, we allow you to plan your budget with confidence, knowing that no unexpected charges will appear on moving day.</p>

<p>Our operational integrity is further reinforced through itemized written contracts. Before any work begins, we provide a detailed document that lists every single item in your inventory, specifying its quantity, condition, and packaging requirements. This contract serves as a mutual agreement, protecting both our clients and our team.</p>
<p>It ensures that there is no ambiguity regarding what is being moved, and it acts as a definitive checklist during the loading and unloading processes. This level of documentation minimizes disputes and ensures accountability at every stage of the relocation journey.</p>

<p>For government and corporate clients, we provide IBA-approved bills that meet strict regulatory and compliance standards. These invoices are meticulously prepared to facilitate seamless claim processing and financial auditing. We understand the bureaucratic requirements of institutional moves and ensure that all documentation aligns with official tender specifications, saving our clients valuable time and administrative effort.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Finally, we offer 100% declared-value transit insurance, providing complete financial protection for your belongings.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Unlike standard policies that cover only a fraction of the item's worth, our insurance covers the full declared value of your goods.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This means that in the unlikely event of damage or loss during transit, you are compensated for the actual cost of replacement, not a depreciated amount.</span></li></ul>
